  "description": "Our 32-year-old Heroine is now reincarnated as a Villainess from a typical novel. Lydia Von Diabolique, a cruel Enchantress, is slain in the middle of the novel by the Prince and Saintess. Our Heroine, a politician in her past life, finds a lot of things different and absurd in this new world. Maybe she'd get used to it? Or maybe she'd be stuck in the past. Or maybe now with our Heroine... the story won't be as typical as it was.\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
